Package: kpclientd
Version: 0.0.1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Katzenpost <katzenqt@katzenpost.network>
Depends: libc6
Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: Katzenpost thin-client daemon (kpclientd)
 The kpclientd daemon for the Katzenpost mix network, built from a pinned
 upstream revision. Ships /usr/bin/kpclientd and a default namenlos client
 configuration at /etc/kpclientd/client.toml. Run it as a systemd user
 service (see the katzenqt package) or directly.
